			}]
			title: "Gem Removal Service"
			x: -3.0d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5B841122EFD8854C"]
			description: ["You've ventured into the nether and returned with some spectacular materials. I believe it's time we upgrade our Reforging from a simple one to a proper one. While all functions remain the same, you'll now be capable of Reforging all the way up to &o&6Mythic&r tier."]
			id: "18DC1665AD8C8EE9"
			rewards: [{
				amount: 100L
				currency: "eternalcurrencies:ancientcoins"
				id: "3B836CCA6264E30B"
				ignore_reward_blocking: true
				type: "eternalcurrencies:currency"
			}]
			tasks: [{
				id: "5B9185469C8B1914"
				item: "apotheosis:reforging_table"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Upgrading The Upgrader"
			x: 0.0d
			y: -4.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["18DC1665AD8C8EE9"]
			description: [
				"When reforging is no longer enough, the energy of a &oNether Star&r allows for the creation of the &o&6Augmentation Table&r. Through this, you'll be able to take your item's existing affixes and reroll or upgrade certain ones for the cost of &6&oSigils of Enhancement&r."
				"When using the table, you will be shown a UI with two slots on the left: one for your item and one for your Sigils of Enhancement. Clicking the drop down menu in the middle will let you select a specific Affix, which you can then either upgrade or re-roll. When upgrading, the new stat will be shown on the left, and when re-rolling a list of possible outcomes will be shown on the left instead."
				"{image:tumblrbumblr:textures/quests/augmentation-table.png width:237 height:135 align:center}"
			]
			icon: "apotheosis:augmenting_table"
			id: "35FF8397225F4952"
			rewards: [{
				amount: 250L
				currency: "eternalcurrencies:ancientcoins"
				id: "2575A39AAE24D12B"
				ignore_reward_blocking: true
				type: "eternalcurrencies:currency"
			}]
			shape: "octagon"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "4F71AB083448A6D5"
					item: "apotheosis:augmenting_table"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					count: 4L
					id: "00A4E4F8A0D2B3BD"
