			title: "Jeweler in Training"
			x: -2.0d
			y: -3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["47532F7269B287FF"]
			description: [
				"The Gem Case is a container useful for storing all types of gems. In its UI, you can insert gems through the blue slot. Retrieving stored gems is as simple as clicking the gem you use to take out."
				"Gem Dust and Rarity Materials can be stored in the slots on the left of the UI. With them, you can easily upgrade a gem using the copies stored in the case."
			]
			id: "2D846DFCA9F7CE9B"
			rewards: [{
