		{
			dependencies: ["15ACD993630984F4"]
			description: [
				"&o&6Universal Bosses&r are ordinary mobs that spawn as an Apothic Boss. Unlike normal bosses, Universal Bosses don't have any special equipment, only increased stats and sometimes &6&oEntity Affixes&r."
				"When killed, Universal Bosses can drop gem dust, enchanted books, and on rare occasions, an Affix Scroll. These scrolls can be &6&ocombined with items in an anvil&r to give that item up to two scroll affixes or broken down at a Salvaging Table for rarity materials."
			]
