		{
			dependencies: ["18DC1665AD8C8EE9"]
			description: [
				"At the top of the reforging hierchy is the &6&oFabled Reforging Table&r. Unlike the tables before it, the Fabled Reforging table is only able to reforge an item to Fabled rarity. In doing so, it also gives the item a &o&4Set Affix&r."
				"Set Affixes add on top of existing affixes and &6&ogrow stronger when multiple items within the same set are used&r."
